{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8eed6006945d280ad37","chatId":"e972711127234c18bb9b43fa6430d113","sessionId":null,"userId":69435,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"F\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"F\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1067,"promptTokens":1646,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:54"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8eed6006945d280ad36","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369774509,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8eed6006945d280ad36","chatId":"e972711127234c18bb9b43fa6430d113","sessionId":null,"userId":69435,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# Instructions\n\nIn this task, you are presented with a scenario, a question, and multiple choices. \nCarefully analyze the scenario and take the perspective of the individual involved.\nThen, select the option that best reflects their perspective or emotional response.\n\n# Output\n\nProvide only one single correct answer to this question.  Do not provide any additional information or explanations. The response should be in the following JSON format:\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nEileen has been diagnosed with a disease that caused her legs to have little to no mobility. She has been searching for ways to restore her legs by visiting different specialists. Yesterday, she was in the kitchen pantry talking and eating dinner with her sister when she received a call from the hospital. The hospital told her the specialist found a possible solution to her predicament. Eileen dropped her phone and sobbed into her hands. Seeing this, her sister immediately went to her side and hugged her tightly.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Eileen's sister ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Nervousness & Hopeful\nB) Joy & Disapproval\nC) Nervousness & Curiosity\nD) Curiosity & Gratitude\nE) Nervousness & Disapproval\nF) Hopeful & Curiosity\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Eileen's sister feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She wants to know why her sister is crying & There is no treatment available for her sister\nB) Her sister can get a treatment that may cure her & There is no treatment available for her sister\nC) She wants to know why her sister is crying & She is wondering why her sister dropped her phone\nD) She wants to know why her sister is crying & She is concerned about the cost of the medical treatment\nE) She was worried about her sister crying & She wants to know why her sister is crying\nF) She wants to know why her sister is crying & Her sister can get a treatment that may cure her","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8eed6006945d280ad37","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369774507,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ce600231ebeb46be9e190b08842d0704"}